<title>USA: Continental Homes to redeem senior notes.</title>
<headline>Continental Homes to redeem senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Homes Holding Corp said on Thursday that it will redeem the remaining principal amount outstanding of its 12 percent senior notes due August 1999.</p>
<p>The construction and financing company set the redemption price for the notes at 104 percent. The notes will be redeemed on August 1.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
